===============================================================================
SAFETY & OPERATIONAL SCOPE DISCLAIMER (OPEN HARDWARE SPECIFICATION)
===============================================================================
This open hardware architecture, software definition (`bonflow_arch.py`), and
reference 3D CAD specification (`BonFlow-Open-v4.0`) are intended strictly for
educational demonstrations and preliminary cold-run fluidic verification using
safe aqueous model fluids at ambient pressure and low-voltage DC 5V power.

Hazardous reagents (e.g., strong acids/bases, volatile/flammable organic
solvents), biological agents, high-pressure operation, or unverified thermal
modifications are outside the validated scope of the DIY open specification.
Users fabricating or modifying modules assume full responsibility for chemical
compatibility, pressure containment, electrical insulation, and local lab
safety compliance.
